melspectrogram.onnx and embedding_model.onnx come from openWakeWord
(https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord), Apache License 2.0; the embedding model is
a conversion of Google's speech_embedding (https://tfhub.dev/google/speech_embedding/1),
Apache License 2.0.

spooky.npz is this project's classifier, trained by tools/wakeword/train.py on synthetic
voices (Piper) and on openWakeWord's public negative features; report.json is its
evaluation on held-out voices and on 2.1 h of held-out real audio.
